    <ele>534.2</ele>
    <name>Bridge crossing over the Amper River</name>
    <cmt>https://d2exd72xrrp1s7.cloudfront.net/www/000/1k7/15/15k1sz2vhlo2cvirgc52a2ba94owsggr5-uhi64293736/0</cmt>
    <desc>Knersi (📍Maisach): Schöne Wege an der Amper 🌊  entlang.</desc>
